---
---

<section class="border-b border-[#232730] bg-[#090a0c] py-20 lg:py-24" id="usage">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        Deployment & Usage Modes
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Reptar fits into existing workflows as an independent backend or as a core service in a multi-app repository.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Mode 1 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Mode 01</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Standalone API</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Initialize an isolated backend project with <code class="text-zinc-200">reptar init my-api</code>.
            Deploy once to Cloudflare Workers and consume the endpoints from external mobile apps, third-party partners, or microservices.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400">Target: Distributed Microservice</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mode 2 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Mode 02</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Monorepo Integration</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Host <code class="text-zinc-200">apps/api</code> (C#) alongside your frontend in a Turborepo.
            Codegen emits <code class="text-zinc-200">packages/rpc</code> directly into the workspace, consumed immediately by TanStack Start, Next.js, or Expo.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400">Target: Full-Stack Web & Mobile</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mode 3 -->
      <div class="rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Mode 03</div>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-white">Scaffolded Starter</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
            Use <code class="text-zinc-200">create-reptar</code> to scaffold a ready-to-run repository.
            Optionally generates a starter frontend with pre-styled shadcn/ui authentication screens already wired to Reptar’s built-in auth slice.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[#1a1d24]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400">Target: Turnkey Application Starter</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Performance & Engineering Standards -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded border border-[#232730] bg-[#111317] p-6 lg:p-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-emerald-400">
            Performance Standard
          </h4>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
            Our explicit engineering benchmark is parity with a Node/Hono backend for CRUD routes on Cloudflare Workers.
            I/O-bound edge routes are dominated by network and database query roundtrips; Reptar keeps overhead minimal through
            isolate-level Wasm caching, raw JSON string exchange across boundaries, and zero runtime reflection.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 shrink-0">
          <a
            href="https://reptar-docs.rocktown-labs.workers.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-950 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 transition-colors rounded"
          >
            Review Benchmarks & Specs
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
